ided to become the sword of the Shogun and carry out the Vision Hunt Decree, then we can only...","nextNodeIds":[721100208]},{"nodeId":721100208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20299,"speakerName":"Yanagiha Arashi","textMapHash":3055661626,"text":"We can only choose our own righteous path. After all, \"a real swordsman must walk the path of righteousness.\"","nextNodeIds":[721100209]},{"nodeId":721100209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20299,"speakerName":"Yanagiha Arashi","textMapHash":730536130,"text":"And yet, Master's own righteousness was defeated in the end.","nextNodeIds":[721100210]},{"nodeId":721100210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20298,"speakerName":"Okazaki Toraemon","textMapHash":1276990370,"text":"That's right. We must avenge them all. Kunihiko, the others — even Iwakura Kouin.","nextNodeIds":[721100211]},{"nodeId":721100211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20298,"speakerName":"Okazaki Toraemon","textMapHash":1623203378,"text":"Such is the righteousness of expelled disciples like ourselves.","nextNodeIds":[721100212]},{"nodeId":721100212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20299,"speakerName":"Yanagiha Arashi","textMapHash":2089604170,"text":"This must also be Master's blessing. Our first object of vengeance came to us, just like that.","nextNodeIds":[721100213]},{"nodeId":721100213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20298,"speakerName":"Okazaki Toraemon","textMapHash":2356570858,"text":"#You are right. You must be {NICKNAME}. I've heard about your story.","nextNodeIds":[721100214]},{"nodeId":721100214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20298,"speakerName":"Okazaki Toraemon","textMapHash":3504610322,"text":"In the world of swordsmen, only blood can cleanse blood. I assume you are prepared to face the Ex-Iwakura Art Menkyo Kaiden?","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7211002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions"